"(i) For facilities categorized as critical access hospitals:
(A) For a first offense, one hundred dollars ($100.00) per
day for each day a facility fails to comply with subsection (a) of this section;

(B) For a second offense, five hundred dollars ($500.00) per
day for each day a facility fails to comply with subsection (a) of this section;
(C) For a third or subsequent offense, one thousand dollars
($1,000.00) per day for each day a facility fails to comply with subsection (a)
of this section;
(ii) For all other facilities, one thousand dollars ($1,000.00)
per day for each day a facility fails to comply with subsection (a) of this
section.". BROWN, L, SINGH
